---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | How To Mithun" description="A bit about who I am and what I do.">
	<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Me</h1>
		<div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
			<p>
				Hi, I'm Hasan Imam Mithun. I'm a developer with a curiosity that spreads across
				programming, machine learning, game design, and drawing.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is where I keep all of that in one place — a mix of writing,
				projects, and half-finished experiments I want a record of.
			</p>
			<p>
				When I'm not writing code, you'll probably find me playing chess,
				sketching, or reading about whatever topic has my attention that week.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>